<div id="u-credit-00143-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocean-funk" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5230323); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5230323&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610009997" alt="oCeaN FunK" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5230323)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ocean-funk" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5230323); return false;">oCeaN FunK</a></span></p>
